1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:04,310
Video "paus" terdampar di Parangtritis
ditonton lebih dari 1 juta kali.

2
00:00:04,480 --> 00:00:05,520
Padahal...

3
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:07,190
itu bukan paus.

4
00:00:07,190 --> 00:00:08,400
Itu hiu paus,

5
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:10,140
ikan terbesar di dunia.

6
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:13,850
Selatan Jawa adalah titik
paling rawan hiu paus terdampar.

7
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:14,860
Kenapa?

8
00:00:15,070 --> 00:00:16,080
Tiap kemarau,

9
00:00:16,080 --> 00:00:18,000
air dingin kaya nutrisi naik,

10
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,330
membuat teri melimpah dekat pantai.

11
00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:22,160
Hiu paus mengejarnya...

12
00:00:22,160 --> 00:00:24,220
lalu terjebak di air dangkal.

13
00:00:24,220 --> 00:00:25,547
Kalau cepat ditolong,

14
00:00:25,547 --> 00:00:26,720
dia bisa selamat.

15
00:00:26,720 --> 00:00:27,360
Jujur,

16
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:29,620
kamu juga ngira itu paus?
